<title>POLAND: LDA SHAREHOLDERS PASS DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>LDA SHAREHOLDERS PASS DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish printing house Lodzka Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA (LDA) voted on Friday to put the firm's entire 1996 0.8-million-zloty net profit into reserve capital, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
